k=r?"Flick with your right index finger, then immediately with your right middle finger \u2013 like strumming.":"Ng\xf3n tr\u1ecf ph\u1ea3i b\u1eadt tr\u01b0\u1edbc, ng\xf3n gi\u1eefa ph\u1ea3i b\u1eadt n\u1ed1i ngay sau \u2013 nh\u01b0 g\u1ea3y \u0111\xe0n."
k=A.a([k,r?"In Sune (R U R' U R U2 R'), the final U2 is smoothest done this way.":"Trong Sune (R U R' U R U2 R'), U2 cu\u1ed1i l\xe0m ki\u1ec3u n\xe0y l\xe0 m\u01b0\u1ee3t nh\u1ea5t."],s)
