i=r?"Finger 4: R, R', R2 with the wrist":"Ng\xf3n 4: R, R', R2 b\u1eb1ng c\u1ed5 tay"
h=r?"Turn the right face with your wrist, thumb staying on the front.":"Xoay m\u1eb7t ph\u1ea3i b\u1eb1ng c\u1ed5 tay, ng\xf3n c\xe1i v\u1eabn \u1edf m\u1eb7t tr\u01b0\u1edbc."
g=r?"R: roll your right wrist up \u2013 the right face turns away from you.":"R: g\u1eadp c\u1ed5 tay ph\u1ea3i l\xean \u2013 m\u1eb7t ph\u1ea3i xoay ra ph\xeda sau."
f=r?"R': roll your wrist down \u2013 the right face turns towards you.":"R': xoay c\u1ed5 tay xu\u1ed1ng \u2013 m\u1eb7t ph\u1ea3i xoay v\u1ec1 ph\xeda b\u1ea1n."
g=A.a([g,f,r?"R2: one big wrist turn, or two Rs back to back.":"R2: m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n xoay c\u1ed5 tay l\u1edbn, ho\u1eb7c hai l\u1ea7n R li\u1ec1n nhau."],s)
