e=r?"Finger 5: Sexy move \xd7 6":"Ng\xf3n 5: Sexy move \xd7 6"
d=r?"Do R U R' U' six times in a row \u2013 the cube returns to where it started.":"L\xe0m R U R' U' 6 l\u1ea7n li\u1ec1n \u2013 cube v\u1ec1 \u0111\xfang nh\u01b0 ban \u0111\u1ea7u."
c=r?"A classic warm-up: keep it even, no pauses between repetitions.":"B\xe0i kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ed9ng kinh \u0111i\u1ec3n: l\xe0m \u0111\u1ec1u, kh\xf4ng d\u1eebng gi\u1eefa c\xe1c l\u1ea7n."
b=r?"Time it in Algorithm mode to track your speed; set a goal for your level.":"B\u1ea5m gi\u1edd \u1edf ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 C\xf4ng th\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ec3 theo d\xf5i t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9; \u0111\u1eb7t m\u1ee5c ti\xeau theo tr\xecnh \u0111\u1ed9."
c=A.a([c,b,r?"Cube not back to start? One turn went wrong \u2013 slow down.":"Cube kh\xf4ng v\u1ec1 nh\u01b0 c\u0169? C\xf3 m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n b\u1ecb xoay sai \u2013 l\xe0m ch\u1eadm l\u1ea1i."],s)
