a8=a2?"Keep the white layer on the bottom the whole solve.":"Gi\u1eef t\u1ea7ng tr\u1eafng \u1edf d\u01b0\u1edbi su\u1ed1t qu\xe1 tr\xecnh gi\u1ea3i."
a8=A.a([a8,a2?"You can see the top layer right away to find the next corner and edge.":"Nh\xecn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ngay t\u1ea7ng tr\xean \u0111\u1ec3 t\xecm g\xf3c v\xe0 c\u1ea1nh ti\u1ebfp theo."],s)
